=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {p:Guilboire (A)} at (F-7) (Conflux #7) to begin this quest.
* He will provide you with two key items, the {@k} {k:Snoll reflector} and {@k} {k:Experiment cheat sheet}.
* Walk north to (G-5) and find the **Impact Point** location.
* The Notorious Monster {m:Frost Bomb Mk-II} will spawn to the west.
* Run up and attack it, which will raise its HP. Your goal is to raise its HP to at least 50%. The higher it is, the more {p:Cruor} reward you receive.
* Pull it towards the **Impact Point**. It will use **Hypothermal Combustion** regardless of its current TP. This will deal damage to the point, but not to you.
** If you disengage, you will fail this quest. This makes {p:Trust Magic} more difficult to use if they pull hate.
* Examine the **Impact Point** to receive a {@k} {k:Frosted snoll reflector}.
** If in a party, all players can receive the {@k} {k:Frosted snoll reflector} from the same {m:Frost Bomb Mk-II} as long as they click the **Impact Point** before it uses **Hypothermal Combustion**.
* Return and speak to {p:Guilboire (A)} for your reward.
** 25 completions of this quest will max fame in this zone.

__Zoning **is** required in order to repeat this quest.__
